<title>GREECE: CLEARING HOUSE TO HANDLE DELTA SHARE CLAIMS.</title>
<headline>CLEARING HOUSE TO HANDLE DELTA SHARE CLAIMS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors that have share title claims from defaulted Delta Securities should contact Magistrate Konstantinos Ganiatsos's office, at Evelpidon Courtrooms, Building 10, office 2, the clearing house said in a statement.</p>
<p>Claimants must have the necessary supporting documents and are requested to file for bearer and registered stock claims seperately. --Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
